Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.70,0:00:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish you a happy new year, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish you the same...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You can drink the rest, Nobi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamaguchi-san, you have some too...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.54,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.46,0:00:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, HAPPY NEW YEAR!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.25,0:00:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't interrupt us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.73,0:00:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That guest drank tons of beer...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.61,0:01:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but even forgot to bring me a new year's souvenir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.74,0:01:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,New year's present is a most awaited thing for kids like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.24,0:01:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But how dare he forgot...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,New year's present!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to mock me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get real presents if you pull this ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.55,0:01:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.55,0:01:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, wait and watch how
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.97,0:01:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd forgot to give you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.14,0:01:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unfair that only you received the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll get one too...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.94,0:01:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'd forgot. Nobi-kun, was it your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.40,0:01:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.48,0:01:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish more guests arrive to our house one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.61,0:02:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Muneshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.37,0:02:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my father's little brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.53,0:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,He is obsessed with treasure hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.66,0:02:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He only comes to drink and eat tons during the new year...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's #1 cheapskate who won't even bring a present to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.08,0:02:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So you want new year's present all the more so badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, this time I'm getting my new year's present.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Heave ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.26,0:02:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,
